OL,3,GNEWSACider makers battle pests and dry
OL,4,Aweather
OL,5,
OL,6,FCider apple growers say this year's
OL,7,Fharvest has been hit by a combination
OL,8,Fof pests and dry weather, with some
OL,9,Freporting fruit dropping before it
OL,10,Fripened and smaller yields than usual.
OL,12,FProducers across the country are
OL,13,Freporting similar problems as
OL,14,Fharvesting gets under way.
OL,16,FAmong them are Justyna and Stuart
OL,17,FJones, who are developing an orchard at
OL,18,Ftheir home near Minsterley in
OL,19,FShropshire with hopes of producing
OL,20,Fcider from their own apples in
OL,21,Fretirement.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
