OL,3,GNEWSACider makers battle pests and dry
OL,4,Aweather
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey say this year has brought a series
OL,7,Fof challenges, from prolonged dry
OL,8,Fspells to damage caused by codling
OL,9,Fmoths, whose larvae burrow into fruit.
